    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 2026-08-24; see the Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Well; blood pressure 118/74, pulse 74; weight 87.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Grip 4-/5; finger extension 4/5; left ankle dorsiflexion 3+/5, right 4+/5; mild dysarthria at the end of a sentence; a few tongue fasciculations; jaw jerk brisk</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Left ankle stable and not swollen</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

